  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/647932854c6ad72554048d44/step-955ff89e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a medium bowl, combine baby spinach, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/647932854c6ad72554048d44/step-77e20a57.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When rice has 10 mins remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot and black beans until tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Add Mexican seasoning and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in passata, the water (for the sauce), vegetable stock powder and remaining butter and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/647932854c6ad72554048d44/step-10cca6f1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice between bowls. Top with black bean chilli and salsa.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and top with sour cream.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/647932854c6ad72554048d44/step-273ff18d.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
